# Feral (Raid) profile for the Ferraz A/B harness. Gear copied from SimC's
# bundled MID1 Feral preset (profiles/MID1/MID1_Druid_Feral.simc) so the
# numbers stay comparable to a maintained reference; only the talent string
# is replaced by the raid build FerrazFeralRaid.yaml is tuned for.
#
# This build differs a lot from the M+ one: no Frantic Frenzy, no Primal
# Wrath, no Apex Predator's Craving, no Rampant Ferocity, no Double-Clawed
# Rake, no Heart of the Wild — and it adds Ashamane's Guidance, Merciless
# Claws, Panther's Guile, Saber Jaws, Focused Frenzy and Coiled to Spring.

